A gate of black iron, standing open. A path leads north.
A walled yard, gone to grass. Doors east and west, the gate south.
There is a lantern here.
You are carrying nothing.
Cold ovens and a long table. Something glints under it.
There is a key here.
You take the key.
You are carrying: key.
A walled yard, gone to grass. Doors east and west, the gate south.
There is a lantern here.
Shelves to the ceiling, all of them empty. A small door north.
A round room with one locked door in the floor.
The key turns. The door swings up on a stair going down.

7 moves, and the stair is open.
